%%{init: {'flowchart': {'curve': 'linear'}} }%%
flowchart TB
    S([Start]) --> A[Monitor Connectivity]
    A --> B{Internet Restored?}
    B -->|No| C[Keep Pending Queue]
    C --> A

    B -->|Yes| D[Load Pending Operations]
    D --> E{Queue Empty?}
    E -->|Yes| F[Set Sync Status to Idle]
    E -->|No| G[Process Next Operation]

    G --> H{Operation Success?}
    H -->|Yes| I[Mark Operation Synced]
    H -->|No| J[Mark Operation Failed]

    I --> K{More Operations?}
    K -->|Yes| G
    K -->|No| L[Fetch Latest Server Data]

    J --> M[Keep Failed Ops for Retry]
    M --> L

    L --> N[Update Local Cache]
    N --> F
    F --> O([End])
